/T (analyzing global fuel prices and taxation trends from 2020 to 2026. The dataset covers 84 countries across 7 global regions and includes information about different fuel types, such as petrol, diesel, and liquefied petroleum gas \(LPG\). The project uses data analytics and visualization techniques to identify patterns, compare regional differences, and understand changes in fuel prices and taxation over time.)
/E (analyzing global fuel prices and taxation trends from 2020 to 2026. The dataset covers 84 countries across 7 global regions and includes information about different fuel types, such as petrol, diesel, and liquefied petroleum gas \(LPG\). The project uses data analytics and visualization techniques to identify patterns, compare regional differences, and understand changes in fuel prices and taxation over time.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [9]
>>
